*> A program whose symbolic map is older than its BMS map.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CUSTMNT.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
COPY SCRMAP.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    EXEC CICS RECEIVE MAP('SCRMAP') MAPSET('SCRSET')
        INTO(SCRMAPI)
    END-EXEC
    DISPLAY CUSTNOI CUSTNMI OLDFLDI
    EXEC CICS RETURN END-EXEC.
